{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0171","paragraphs":[{"id":"pafeb84070e8c-1","text":"清晨帘幕卷轻霜。"},{"id":"p83035e69cdb8-1","text":"呵手试梅妆。"},{"id":"pb3d502dfc05f-1","text":"都缘自有离恨，故画作远山长。"},{"id":"p1051a684e3b2-1","text":"思往事，惜流芳。"},{"id":"pa2fef0f871b3-1","text":"易成伤。"},{"id":"pf61e68a56590-1","text":"拟歌先敛，欲笑还颦，最断人肠。"}]}